  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">202</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">7</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">届</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">本科生免试推荐研究生相关工作安排及要求如下：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">一、</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><b> </b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">学生申请推荐免试攻读研究生应符合以下条件</font></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>1<font face=\"宋体\">）纳入国家普通本科招生计划录取的</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">202</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">7</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">届</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">应届毕业生；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>2<font face=\"宋体\">）诚实守信，学风端正，品行优良，遵守法律法规和校规校纪，未因学业违纪受过处分，如受其它处分已解除；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>3<font face=\"宋体\">）符合推荐单位制定的推荐办法和具体要求，原则上不低于以下基本条件：</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">①</font><font face=\"宋体\">全部课程平均学分绩或必修及限选课程</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">平均学分绩成绩排名达到院系内专业前</font>80%</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">；</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">②</font><font face=\"宋体\">必修及限选课程出现考核不合格的记录</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">&le;2</font><font face=\"宋体\">门次；</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">③</font><font face=\"宋体\">已通过体育</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">(1)-(4)</font><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>4<font face=\"宋体\">）本人承诺若被接收为推荐免试研究生，在研究生入学之前不开具出国成绩单。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">二、学生个人申请</font></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">所有</font></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">今</font></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">年参加免试推荐攻读校内外博士</font>/<font face=\"宋体\">硕士学位研究生的本科生</font></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">，均应在以下规定时间内登录清华大学研究生申请服务系统（</font>https://yzbm.tsinghua.edu.cn<font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">填报免试推荐申请信息，否则一律无效。</font></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">清华大学研究生申请服务系统定于</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\">202</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">年</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">月</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">上</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">午</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">0</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\">:00<font face=\"宋体\">开放，</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">年</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">月</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\">28</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">下</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">午</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">5</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\">:00<font face=\"宋体\">关闭</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">如有变更将在清华大学研招网（</font>https://yz.tsinghua.edu.cn<font face=\"宋体\">）及时通知。</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">《关于清华大学</font>202</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">7</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名的通知》</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">详见清华大学研招网</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">如下链接</font> </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">https://yz.tsinghua.edu.cn/info/1024/3234.htm<font face=\"宋体\">。推免系统操作手册见附件</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">1</font><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.1000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">提醒</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">注意：</font></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <ol> \n  <li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">推荐至</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">本校及校外其他高校或单位</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">读研的所有学生</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">都必须在以上</font></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">规定时间内</font></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">通过</font></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">以上系统</font></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">填报信息</font></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li> \n  <li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">推荐至</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">校外其他高校或单位读研</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">的学生</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">，还应按照</font></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">外推单位要求</font></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">履行相关报名手续（在校内系统填报外推信息仅用于申请我校推荐名额）。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li> \n  <li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">未在本校系统填报申请信息，默认放弃申请推荐名额，后续将无法获得我校推荐名额。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li> \n  <li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><font face=\"宋体\">请报名本校读研的同学密切关注报考院系的相关通知，并</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">做好</font></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">8<font face=\"宋体\">月</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">1</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">2</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">日</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">（含）</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">之</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">后返校参加考核的准备。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li> \n </ol> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">三、学生所在院系审核学生推荐资格、确定推荐名单</font></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">学生所在院系推荐工作小组依据本院系制定的推荐办法，对所有申请校内外推荐免试读研的学生的推荐资格进行审核，择优推荐，确定推荐名单，并进行公示。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">学生学业成绩和排名没有达到院系制定的推荐办法具体要求，但有特殊学术专长或者具有突出培养潜质的，可以填写《清华大学推荐免试攻读博士</font>/<font face=\"宋体\">硕士学位资格申请表》（附件</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">2</font><font face=\"宋体\">），并附三名本校</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">相关</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">专业具有研究生指导资格的教师推荐信，提交至所在院系教学办公室，</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">由所属院系审核确定推荐资格</font></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">四、资格复审</font></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">下一年春季学期末，学校推免生遴选工作</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">领导小</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">组对已获得</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">本校</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">拟录取初选资格的学生进行资格复审。未通过复审的，取消推荐资格。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">资格复审基本条件为：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">.</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">已达到本科毕业要求，能够正常毕业；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">.</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">获得拟录取初选资格后，未受到任何纪律处分。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">3</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">.</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">获得拟录取初选资格后，未出现培养方案要求的必修和限选课程考核不合格；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">4</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">.</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">综合论文训练考核成绩达到等级制</font>B-(<font face=\"宋体\">含</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">)</font><font face=\"宋体\">以上；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">5</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">.</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">如学生提前选修研究生课程、且已将此类课程转入研究生阶段，研究生学位课不及格不超过</font>1<font face=\"宋体\">门次。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">五、其他</font></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">附件</font>3<font face=\"宋体\">为免试推研</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">Q&A</font><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">供同学们参考。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">联系人：张</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">一</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span></span></span></span><a href target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"line-height:130%\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">jwcjwk@tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-top:4px; text-indent:12.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"margin-top:4px; text-indent:12.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"margin-top:4px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:left blank 184.6000pt \"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">清华大学</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">教务处</font></span></span></span> </span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-top:4px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">202</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">6</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">年</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"font-family: \"Times New Roman\";\">月</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\" style=\"\">30</font></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">日</font></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n</div>",
  "contentText": "202 7 届 本科生免试推荐研究生相关工作安排及要求如下： 一、 学生申请推荐免试攻读研究生应符合以下条件 （ 1 ）纳入国家普通本科招生计划录取的 202 7 届 应届毕业生； （ 2 ）诚实守信，学风端正，品行优良，遵守法律法规和校规校纪，未因学业违纪受过处分，如受其它处分已解除； （ 3 ）符合推荐单位制定的推荐办法和具体要求，原则上不低于以下基本条件： ① 全部课程平均学分绩或必修及限选课程 平均学分绩成绩排名达到院系内专业前 80% ； ② 必修及限选课程出现考核不合格的记录 &le;2 门次； ③ 已通过体育 (1)-(4) 。 （ 4 ）本人承诺若被接收为推荐免试研究生，在研究生入学之前不开具出国成绩单。 二、学生个人申请 所有 今 年参加免试推荐攻读校内外博士 / 硕士学位研究生的本科生 ，均应在以下规定时间内登录清华大学研究生申请服务系统（ https://yzbm.tsinghua.edu.cn ） ， 填报免试推荐申请信息，否则一律无效。 清华大学研究生申请服务系统定于 202 6 年 7 月 1 日 上 午 1 0 :00 开放， 202 6 年 7 月 28 日 下 午 1 5 :00 关闭 ， 如有变更将在清华大学研招网（ https://yz.tsinghua.edu.cn ）及时通知。 《关于清华大学 202 7 年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名的通知》 详见清华大学研招网 如下链接 https://yz.tsinghua.edu.cn/info/1024/3234.htm 。推免系统操作手册见附件 1 。 提醒 注意： 推荐至 本校及校外其他高校或单位 读研的所有学生 ， 都必须在以上 规定时间内 通过 以上系统 填报信息 。 推荐至 校外其他高校或单位读研 的学生 ，还应按照 外推单位要求 履行相关报名手续（在校内系统填报外推信息仅用于申请我校推荐名额）。 未在本校系统填报申请信息，默认放弃申请推荐名额，后续将无法获得我校推荐名额。 请报名本校读研的同学密切关注报考院系的相关通知，并 做好 8 月 1 2 日 （含） 之 后返校参加考核的准备。 三、学生所在院系审核学生推荐资格、确定推荐名单 学生所在院系推荐工作小组依据本院系制定的推荐办法，对所有申请校内外推荐免试读研的学生的推荐资格进行审核，择优推荐，确定推荐名单，并进行公示。 学生学业成绩和排名没有达到院系制定的推荐办法具体要求，但有特殊学术专长或者具有突出培养潜质的，可以填写《清华大学推荐免试攻读博士 / 硕士学位资格申请表》（附件 2 ），并附三名本校 相关 专业具有研究生指导资格的教师推荐信，提交至所在院系教学办公室， 由所属院系审核确定推荐资格 。 四、资格复审 下一年春季学期末，学校推免生遴选工作 领导小 组对已获得 本校 拟录取初选资格的学生进行资格复审。未通过复审的，取消推荐资格。 资格复审基本条件为： 1 . 已达到本科毕业要求，能够正常毕业； 2 . 获得拟录取初选资格后，未受到任何纪律处分。 3 . 获得拟录取初选资格后，未出现培养方案要求的必修和限选课程考核不合格； 4 . 综合论文训练考核成绩达到等级制 B-( 含 ) 以上； 5 . 如学生提前选修研究生课程、且已将此类课程转入研究生阶段，研究生学位课不及格不超过 1 门次。 五、其他 附件 3 为免试推研 Q&A ， 供同学们参考。 联系人：张 一 ， jwcjwk@tsinghua.edu.cn 清华大学 教务处 202 6 年 6 月 30 日",
